abstract: >-
  Selected notebook implementation ported to Python, sanitized public notebooks,
  documentation, synthetic demonstration inputs and newly measured demo results.
  Supplied F1-F9 payloads and historical research reports are excluded. The demo
  does not reproduce the manuscript's original numerical results or UCEF analysis
  and is not production cryptography. Team approval reported/confirmed by repository
  maintainer Dwi Wijonarko on 2026-10-08.
